OL,3,GNEWSAHow Hampshire became a focus in
OL,4,Athe Channel migrant debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe focus on small boat crossings until
OL,7,Fnow has been largely on Kent but, after
OL,8,Fvessels began heading for the Hampshire
OL,9,Fcoast a few weeks ago, national
OL,10,Fattention has turned to Portsmouth and
OL,11,FGosport.
OL,13,FOn 6 September, 140 migrants were
OL,14,Fbrought ashore at Eastney in Portsmouth
OL,15,Fafter attempting to cross from
OL,16,FNormandy, sparking anti-migrant
OL,17,Fprotests in the city.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
