OL,3,GNEWSAHow Hampshire became a focus in
OL,4,Athe Channel migrant debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo weeks later, on 22 September,
OL,7,Fmigrants were intercepted south of the
OL,8,FIsle of Wight. More than 100 protesters
OL,9,Fgathered in Gosport after reports they
OL,10,Fwere being brought to the town but the
OL,11,Flifeboats were ultimately diverted to
OL,12,FDover.
OL,14,FOn 4 October, a third boat left
OL,15,FNormandy bound for the Hampshire coast,
OL,16,Fwith 150 migrants on board.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
